From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Grische <github@grische.xyz>
Date: Tue, 18 Aug 2026 01:25:03 +0200
Subject: MIPS: dts: intel-mips: make xrx500.dtsi self-contained

xrx500.dtsi uses GIC_SHARED and the CLK_* / GCLK_* clock cell values but
includes neither header, relying on every board file to include them first.
That works only because all three currently do, in the right order, and it
means the SoC description cannot be included by anything except a file that
already knows what it needs.

Move the two includes into xrx500.dtsi and drop them from the board files.
No DTB changes: the macros and their expansions are identical, only the
point of definition moves.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5
Signed-off-by: Grische <github@grische.xyz>

